description "Barriss Offee

A fast Sith with Force Sense immunity, specializing in ambushes and surprise attacks. Lacks the defensive strength for prolonged duels.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- +12% Rate of Fire
- Lightsaber (Dual/Blue)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- +135% Special Damage Multiplier
-- EX Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]
--- +33% Damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Pull (2) 
- Sense (2) 
- Grip (3) ^3[CS3]
- Mind Trick (1) ^3[CS4]
- Speed (3)

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Dexterity (3)
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Force Block (3)
- Force Focus (2)
- Aerial Force Regen
- Sense Immunity
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]"
